{
  "declaredLength": 4396,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100100002010000000021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estos jóvenes de hoy en día no respetan nada.\n¿No ves que estamos en familia?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No te pongas así, abuelo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006F00200074006500200070006F006E00670061007300200061007300ED002C00200061006200750065006C006F0021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Esperen un momento!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSiempre tiene que girar todo en torno a\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>... Bueno, ahora yo...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Yo tengo algo que decir!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Pero antes quiero retarlos a un combate a\nlos dos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005000650072006F00200061006E007400650073002000710075006900650072006F002000720065007400610072006C006F00730020006100200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200061000A006C006F007300200064006F00730021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Si a <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> no le parece mal, ¡yo me\nsumo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntodo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000053006900200061002000100002010000000020006E006F0020006C006500200070006100720065006300650020006D0061006C002C002000A10079006F0020006D0065000A00730075006D006F00100001BE00000A006100100001BE00000A0074006F0064006F0021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En otra ocasión",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0020006F0074007200610020006F006300610073006900F3006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Justo ahora no tienes ganas de combatir?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004A007500730074006F002000610068006F007200610020006E006F0020007400690065006E00650073002000670061006E0061007300200064006500200063006F006D00620061007400690072003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con mi Scrafty y compañía voy a ganar.\n¡Ni lo pongo en tela de juicio!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Nunca me niego a un combate contra uno\nde mis queridos Nariáticos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E0075006E006300610020006D00650020006E006900650067006F0020006100200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E00740072006100200075006E006F000A006400650020006D006900730020007100750065007200690064006F00730020004E00610072006900E1007400690063006F00730021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En cierto sentido, yo también soy Naria,\nasí que será por partida doble.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esperen un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730070006500720065006E00200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡No te acobardes ahora! Ocasiones como\nesta no se dan todos los días.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004E006F002000740065002000610063006F006200610072006400650073002000610068006F0072006100210020004F0063006100730069006F006E0065007300200063006F006D006F000A00650073007400610020006E006F002000730065002000640061006E00200074006F0064006F00730020006C006F00730020006400ED00610073002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me parece muy bien. Sobre todo porque voy\na ganar yo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500200070006100720065006300650020006D007500790020006200690065006E002E00200053006F00620072006500200074006F0064006F00200070006F007200710075006500200076006F0079000A0061002000670061006E0061007200200079006F002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Esperar qué? ¿A morir de aburrimiento?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004500730070006500720061007200200071007500E9003F002000BF00410020006D006F0072006900720020006400650020006100620075007200720069006D00690065006E0074006F003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si ganamos, nos tendrán que ayudar a hacer\nmás Pan de Naria.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069002000670061006E0061006D006F0073002C0020006E006F0073002000740065006E0064007200E1006E0020007100750065002000610079007500640061007200200061002000680061006300650072000A006D00E10073002000500061006E0020006400650020004E0061007200690061002E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vamos, quitémonos de encima cuanto antes\nel combate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061006D006F0073002C0020007100750069007400E9006D006F006E006F007300200064006500200065006E00630069006D00610020006300750061006E0074006F00200061006E007400650073000A0065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Megaevoluciona para darles una megapaliza,\nEelektross! ¡Se van a paralizar del susto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos, Excadrill! ¡Megaevoluciona y muéstrales\nlo que eres capaz de hacer!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos, Scrafty, megaevoluciona y muéstrales\ntodo tu potencial!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F0073002C00200053006300720061006600740079002C0020006D00650067006100650076006F006C007500630069006F006E0061002000790020006D007500E90073007400720061006C00650073000A0074006F0064006F00200074007500200070006F00740065006E006300690061006C0021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ganamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470061006E0061006D006F00730021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver, ¿qué es lo que querías decirme?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020007600650072002C002000BF0071007500E90020006500730020006C006F00200071007500650020007100750065007200ED00610073002000640065006300690072006D0065003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Voy a confeccionar un vestido solo para ti\ny quiero que algún día te lo pongas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está bien. Pero solo si me gusta el diseño, ¿eh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E10020006200690065006E002E0020005000650072006F00200073006F006C006F0020007300690020006D006500200067007500730074006100200065006C0020006400690073006500F1006F002C002000BF00650068003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo también quiero uno!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTengo que ir en conjunto si quiero meterme bien\nen el papel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué creepy!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E900200063007200650065007000790021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por cierto, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, toma esto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0072002000630069006500720074006F002C00200010000201000000002C00200074006F006D00610020006500730074006F002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recibiste el Conjunto deportivo de Naria.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006300690062006900730074006500200065006C00200043006F006E006A0075006E0074006F0020006400650070006F0072007400690076006F0020006400650020004E0061007200690061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y para ti, uno de los pancitos de mi abuelo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900200070006100720061002000740069002C00200075006E006F0020006400650020006C006F0073002000700061006E006300690074006F00730020006400650020006D006900200061006200750065006C006F002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guau, un Pan de Naria. Lo atesoraré\ntoda mi vida.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007500610075002C00200075006E002000500061006E0020006400650020004E0061007200690061002E0020004C006F00200061007400650073006F00720061007200E9000A0074006F006400610020006D006900200076006900640061002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Qué estás diciendo?! Es para que te lo comas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF0051007500E9002000650073007400E10073002000640069006300690065006E0064006F003F00210020004500730020007000610072006100200071007500650020007400650020006C006F00200063006F006D00610073002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy que echo chispas por no haber ganado,\ncon todo lo que entrenó mi Eelektross.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El Pan de Naria es todo un éxito. Estoy pensando\nen abrir tiendas por todas las regiones.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es importante hablar con sinceridad.\nAlgún día lo conseguiré...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007300200069006D0070006F007200740061006E007400650020006800610062006C0061007200200063006F006E002000730069006E0063006500720069006400610064002E000A0041006C006700FA006E0020006400ED00610020006C006F00200063006F006E00730065006700750069007200E9002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    }
